    ['Amulet of natural armor +2', 'magic', 0, '8000 gp', ['medium', 'wondrous'], 'This amulet, usually crafted from bone or beast scales, toughens the wearer’s body and flesh, giving him an enhancement bonus to his natural armor bonus of from +1 to +5, depending on the kind of amulet. Faint transmutation; CL 5th.'],
