    ['Weapon, +1', 'magic', 0, '2300 gp', ['medium', 'minor', 'weapon'], 'A +1 enhancement bonus on attack and damage rolls. The price includes the 300 gp for a masterwork weapon; add the base weapon’s cost. A double weapon pays for each end, and 50 arrows, bolts or bullets are priced as one weapon. Faint evocation; CL 3rd.'],
